{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[GAME INTRODUCTION]</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve the riddles and escape from the room!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game comes with auto-save, so you can play from the beginning of the game at any time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you have trouble solving the riddle, you can see the hints and solutions in the game. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >[How to play]</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click on the place you are interested in to investigate.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Select an item by clicking on it, and click on the location where you want to use it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click on the item to enlarge it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some items will combine with each other if you use another item on the enlarged item. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tiny Room Collection</strong> is a game in which you use the mouse to click on various places in the room, solve puzzles, and escape from the room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 21 tiny rooms in total.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you escape from all the rooms? </p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Steps","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3533720/958ee9334f2eebf440599a6eb684f51cfd17d57a.jpg"},{"name":"Arrived at the turnaround point","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3533720/0a1bb3b7a9608c3e15c88384e3ff0f0e7554dfa8.jpg"},{"name":"Amazing!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3533720/1d4a21724f0d7b5a84f6244ec2df4ef02490352b.jpg"},{"name":" Friends with a Mouse","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3533720/530c99548132ecd6ffcaa4b312507b0dbbf25c82.jpg"},{"name":"Brilliant mind!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3533720/0